Cell["\<\
IMPORTANT NOTE: this notebook also cross-check the results of \
arXiv:2510:09597 with the code of  PRD 108, 044041 \
(https://journals.aps.org/prd/abstract/10.1103/PhysRevD.108.044041 ) (see \
arXiv:https://arxiv.org/abs/2303.16798 ), which is now publicly available \
here https://github.com/vskoupy/KerrSpinningFluxes . Their code numerically \
solve the MPD equations in 2nd order form via a Fourier series decomposition.
The numerical results of arXiv:2303.16798 perfectly matches the analytic \
expressions of arXiv:2510:09597.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.969675573035529*^9, 3.969675619131031*^9}, {
  3.969675668107026*^9, 3.969675699202033*^9}, {3.969675790241297*^9, 
