Cell["\<\
Run the Drummond, Hughes and Skoup\[YAcute]  code of arXiv: \
https://arxiv.org/abs/2303.16798 (available here \
https://github.com/vskoupy/KerrSpinningFluxes ) to solve the linear in the \
secondary spin MPD equations in second order form  in the fixed turning \
points gauge. Unfortunately, their  code crashes in for equatorial limits, so \
we compute the trajectories and velocities for nearly equatorial orbits.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.929336406273185*^9, 3.929336464833108*^9}, {
   3.979905975692321*^9, 3.979906019474228*^9}, {3.979906467058899*^9, 
