Cell[TextData[{
 "In this Section, we also checked that the shifts to periodic orbits \
converge to the homoclinic orbits near the separatrix. Notice that the \
periodic orbits converge",
 StyleBox[" logarithmically",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " to homoclinic orbits; to show numerical convergence, we need high \
precision."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.969675428529798*^9, 3.96967547520562*^9}, {
  4.00070513107165*^9, 4.0007051822332773`*^9}, {4.000705216733542*^9, 
